<title>USA: North Muskegon PS, Mich., won by First of America.</title>
<headline>North Muskegon PS, Mich., won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America said it won $8.200 million of North Muskegon PS, Mich., general obligation 1996 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.383 percent.</p>
</text>
